      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to rule too many of these out. MY CHARM (2) has been freshened up since a game third over a staying trip at Warwick Farm a month ago. Honest mare whose ability over longer trips is her trump card in a race that should be run at a solid clip. The local MASTER RILEY (6) looks ready to win after making a late charge only to just miss last time out over 1500m here. Enjoys a cosy run out of gate one and at the fourth run back should be spot on for this assignment. CAP D'AIL (1) defeated a subsequent winner in Mayleigh two runs back over this course and distance. Couldn't repeat the dose here ten days ago but certainly deserves another chance. MONTE MAXIMUS (8) has been struggling over shorter trips. Placed once from two tries at the mile. Might need the longer journey now. SONNIG (7) caused a minor boil-over at Hawkesbury last time. Can roll along and play havoc again.",
